# screen was traced to the 0x407f0780 value (bit23=0) introduced in AviumUI
# bringup 289a63a. Note: normal system uses 0x407f0780 (works fine); recovery
# environment needs 0x41ff0780. This contradicts the earlier CLAUDE.md rule 4.
